    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Where was I last night? Oh, hihi. I think the Mayor can
        vouch for me.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 5757ab72-f78b-45f8-aadd-e6227dd0051c
    Position: {x: 1620, y: 812}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: LunaMidnightRoseDialogueEvent
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Let's go cheer Poppy up! Meet me there darling.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: e56d670a-166a-458b-bcea-972ad496a64c
    Position: {x: 1351, y: 812}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: By the way, do you know how Poppy is doing? I am sure
        this ordeal must be taxing. Poppy has always been so fond of the colors of
        all the flowers.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 387c6883-214b-4792-9fb7-a702668501be
    Position: {x: 1173, y: -14}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: The colors are gone!? I did not know! Makes sense why
        people are so upset today then. I am sure you will find the culprit soon
        enough darling.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 8d0cae8d-9955-47cf-b917-3245bf1fe72c
    Position: {x: 1401, y: -14}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
